#usda 1.0
(
    "Generic EIA-310 19-inch cabinet, 48 U — Liquid-cooled rack-scale GPU configuration: 18 x 1U compute, 9 x 1U scale-up switch, 8 x 1U power shelves. Parametric asset generated by AIDC Studio tools/asset-pipeline/generic_usd.py from tools/asset-pipeline/generic_spec.json. Not a model of any vendor product; no logos or lettering."
